{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/9981","id":5311239030,"node_id":"PR_kwDOJWP4788AAAABPJMTdg","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/9981","diff_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/9981.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/9981.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/9981","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/9981/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/9981/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/9981/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/statuses/409458a95652b8f661c2bb3ac211778aa6c990ee","number":9981,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(identity): keep private keys and password-derived hashes out of auth logs (#6181)","user":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nFixes the remaining live half of #6181 on current main. The SSH (`cmd/ssh`) and web (`web`) surfaces were already cleaned and carry AST guard tests; the transitive helper package the SSH path calls — `pkgs/identity/auth` — still wrote credential material to the log:\n\n- `InsertPrivateKey` logged the base64-encoded **ed25519 private key** (`privateKeyString`) in three places.\n- `InsertHashPublicKey` / `GetPublicKeyFromHash` logged the **password-derived SHA-256 hash** (`hash`) — a replayable password equivalent in this scheme, since the hash is what the gateway looks keys up by.\n- `InsertTextPublicKey` / `GetPublicKeyFromText` / `GetPublicKey` logged the same derived value as `text`.\n\nThis is exactly the scope gap task 10653 was blocked on in 2026-11-06; its preserved WIP branch no longer exists, so the fix was redone against current main.\n\n## Changes\n\n- `pkgs/identity/auth/auth.go`: the seven log calls above now emit only non-secret metadata (key type, hash/text type, public key string, ids, rows affected). Private-key material and password-derived values no longer reach any log record. Storage behavior is unchanged — the values are still written to the DB, just never logged.\n- `pkgs/identity/auth/auth_logging_test.go` (new): AST guard mirroring the existing `cmd/ssh` and `web` suites — fails if a logger call in the six credential-handling functions references `pk`, `privateKeyString`, `hash`, `text`, or `password`, or a field of those names.\n\n## Tests\n\n- `go test ./auth ./web ./cmd/ssh` — all pass, including the new guard.\n- `go build ./...` for the identity module fails in a pre-existing, unrelated place (the charm fork's module-cache copy references undefined migration symbols); the three affected packages build and test clean.\n\nCloses #6181 (with the already-landed ssh/web halves).\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1797251392&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=9981&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F9981&signature=da3fce15c2476a0723c4e5233db6df6ac878ebcf43fd943a42ef234a8ba8ca70\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/9981?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Authentication logs no longer include private-key material or supplied hash and text values. Public-key logging now reports only the public-key type and representation.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","labels":[{"id":13198400136,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJWP4788AAAADEq-aiA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/labels/audit:complete","name":"audit:complete","description":"PR fully implemented spawning issue","color":"0e8a16","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-14T12:29:48Z","updated_at":"2026-11-24T01:30:42Z","closed_at":"2026-11-14T12:35:48Z","merged_at":"2026-11-14T12:35:48Z","merge_commit_sha":"afbc83f331ea1836133f67f066f139874f96b8d0","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[{"id